  "notes": "Pololu A4988 carrier. Joins RESET to SLEEP for normal use. VMOT 8-35 V with a 100 uF capacitor across VMOT/GND; VDD 3-5.5 V logic. 1A/1B to one motor coil, 2A/2B to the other. Set the current limit on the trim pot before running. Never unplug the motor while VMOT is on.",
